        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick a course and tee off!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A satisfying golf experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your golf skills to the test in a pixel-art world where practice, creativity, and a touch of luck all play a part. Read the terrain, deal with tricky lies, find clever angles to the hole, and chase the lowest score you can—sometimes the risky shot is the right one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942500/extras/cf1bb7de6e8344c55379ab898639da1e.poster.avif?t=1766081196\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942500/extras/cf1bb7de6e8344c55379ab898639da1e.webm?t=1766081196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942500/extras/cf1bb7de6e8344c55379ab898639da1e.mp4?t=1766081196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >User-created content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game editor to build and upload your own courses to the Steam Workshop. Add trees, traps, and stylish details to craft a satisfying challenge… or go completely wild with absurd layouts, brutal hazards, and devious terrain that only the bravest golfers will dare to tackle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942500/extras/7d71b3a12932a80d83e795bb5fd0bdf2.poster.avif?t=1766081196\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942500/extras/7d71b3a12932a80d83e795bb5fd0bdf2.webm?t=1766081196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942500/extras/7d71b3a12932a80d83e795bb5fd0bdf2.mp4?t=1766081196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick a course and tee off!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A satisfying golf experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your golf skills to the test in a pixel-art world where practice, creativity, and a touch of luck all play a part. Read the terrain, deal with tricky lies, find clever angles to the hole, and chase the lowest score you can—sometimes the risky shot is the right one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942500/extras/cf1bb7de6e8344c55379ab898639da1e.poster.avif?t=1766081196\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942500/extras/cf1bb7de6e8344c55379ab898639da1e.webm?t=1766081196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942500/extras/cf1bb7de6e8344c55379ab898639da1e.mp4?t=1766081196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >User-created content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game editor to build and upload your own courses to the Steam Workshop. Add trees, traps, and stylish details to craft a satisfying challenge… or go completely wild with absurd layouts, brutal hazards, and devious terrain that only the bravest golfers will dare to tackle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942500/extras/7d71b3a12932a80d83e795bb5fd0bdf2.poster.avif?t=1766081196\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942500/extras/7d71b3a12932a80d83e795bb5fd0bdf2.webm?t=1766081196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942500/extras/7d71b3a12932a80d83e795bb5fd0bdf2.mp4?t=1766081196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
